<how_to_write_issues>
If pass=false, include issues[].

For each violation, add ONE issue with:
- severity: high | medium | low
- ruleId: choose the closest match from CritiqueRuleIdSchema
- sectionId: section.sectionId
- location:
  - kind: heading | paragraph | sentence | link | throughout
  - index: integer or null
- evidence: a direct quote from sectionMarkdown (verbatim)
- fix: a surgical rewrite directive that stays within this section’s scope

Guidance:
- Evidence must be short and specific.
- Fix must be actionable and scoped (what to change, not vague advice).
- Do NOT propose adding new products/links/claims.
</how_to_write_issues>
